          "id": 825976975,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Though I dislike magic numbers, I wonder why you changed the value. Is there a reason for that?  Would it make more sense to just change it to a maximum value of qint32 \"std::numeric_limits<qint32>::max()\" would give that value.\n\nThe change by itself makes absolute sense to me, even worse having the magic numbers inside the .ui file",
