        {
          "id": 826002908,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Is the size of `int` documented anywhere in Qt?\n```\nProperties\nbottom : int\ntop : int\n```\n\"typically\" doesn't inspire a lot of confidence in what may happen in the future.\n```\ntop : int\nThis property holds the validator's highest acceptable value\n\nBy default, this property's value is derived from the highest signed integer available (typically 2147483647).\n```",
          "author": {
            "id": 6701257,
