        {
          "id": 826384249,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "> and int is by NO MEANS well-defined in cross-plattform development\n\n...although the only UN\\*Xes I know of that are neither ILP32 (32-bit `int`) nor LP64 (32-bit `int`) are some weirdos such as some versions of UNICOS on Cray, and Windows is is either ILP32 or LLP64 (32-bit `int`).\n\nI.e., I don't know whether anything on which we run has `int` as anything other than 32-bit.\n\n> On \\*nix for example, they are allways 8-byte long when you are operating on a 64-bit plattform. 4-byte on a 32-bit plattform.\n\nSome platforms were, at least for a while, both 32-bit and 64-bit, supporting both types of applications.\n\n> On Windows it strongly depends on the context of your application execution, so for instance in the beginning of moving to 64-bit, all console applications where using 4-byte pointers even if executed on 64-bit.\n\nWas that just a variant of, for example, the early days of 64-bit Mac OS X (as it was called at the time), where command-line applications were the *only* ones that could run fully 64-bit, as the GUI toolkits hadn't yet been built with both 32-bit and 64-bit code?  I.e., was Windows initially only capable of running 64-bit code in the NATIVE, WINDOWS, and maybe BOOT_APPLICATION and EFI_* subsystems, but not in the CONSOLE subsystem?\n\nIn any case, both CONSOLE and WINDOWS subsystems are supported for 32-bit and 64-bit code now and, as far as I know, that was the case since when we first did 64-bit Wireshark for Windows.",
          "author": {
            "id": 5636682,
            "username": "guyharris",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Guy Harris",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/1b7c243a9b1d6587a9a9067e5d83aba1e87212df7c4eeae3690f791ecbe4675a?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/guyharris"
          },
          "created_at": "2022-01-31T09:56:10.114Z",
          "updated_at": "2022-01-31T09:56:10.114Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 137717612,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": true,
          "resolved_by": {
            "id": 2498449,
            "username": "rknall",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Roland Knall",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/9e1d973c5007651b2ca47071f80324c2de5349d873e365cf0761df5542dfe382?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/rknall"
          },
          "resolved_at": "2022-02-01T21:24:16.749Z",
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
